{"id":73617,"date":"2026-11-09T17:00:06","date_gmt":"2026-11-09T17:00:06","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=73617"},"modified":"2026-11-09T18:01:52","modified_gmt":"2026-11-09T17:01:52","slug":"piramide-radical-trail","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/piramide-radical-trail\/","title":{"rendered":"Pir\u00e2mide Radical Trail 2027"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Pir\u00e2mide Radical Trail 2027<\/span><\/h2><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>Pir\u00e2mide Radical Trail 2027<\/strong> realiza-se no dia <strong>17 de Janeiro de 2027<\/strong> (Domingo), com partida \u00e0s <strong>09:00<\/strong> junto \u00e0 Sede da Junta de Freguesia da <strong>Gandra<\/strong>, no concelho de <strong>Ponte de Lima<\/strong>, distrito de <strong>Viana do Castelo<\/strong>. O evento \u00e9 organizado pelo <strong>Pir\u00e2mide Radical Clube<\/strong> e tem lota\u00e7\u00e3o limitada a 300 participantes.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O programa desportivo \u00e9 disputado em tr\u00eas dist\u00e2ncias pelos trilhos florestais e serranos de Ponte de Lima: o <strong>Trail Longo (25 km, 1000 m D+)<\/strong> com partida \u00e0s 09:00 (09:15 no programa do regulamento), o <strong>Trail Curto (16 km, 600 m D+)<\/strong> com partida \u00e0s 09:15 (09:20 no regulamento) e a <strong>Caminhada (10 km, 350 m D+)<\/strong> com in\u00edcio \u00e0s 09:20 (09:25 no regulamento).<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es incluem dorsal com chip de cronometragem eletr\u00f3nica, abastecimentos l\u00edquidos e s\u00f3lidos (em regime de semiautonomia sem copos descart\u00e1veis), pr\u00e9mio de participa\u00e7\u00e3o Finisher, seguro desportivo, transporte em caso de abandono e banhos. Consulta o calend\u00e1rio nacional de provas de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/trail\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Trail Running em Portugal<\/a>.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase