,00\u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"><\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\"><div style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 200px;\"><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Caminhada<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Caminhada 10 km<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 17 de Janeiro de 2027 \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 09:20 \u2022 \u23f1\ufe0f Limite: 3h00<\/span><\/div><div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\"><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase \u00danica:<\/strong> 8,00\u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"><\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/ul><\/div><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza o Pir\u00e2mide Radical Trail 2027?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O Pir\u00e2mide Radical Trail 2027 realiza-se no domingo, 17 de Janeiro de 2027, na freguesia da Gandra, concelho de Ponte de Lima (Viana do Castelo), com secretariado e partida junto \u00e0 Sede da Junta de Freguesia da Gandra.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias, desn\u00edveis e tempos limite de cada prova?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento compreende tr\u00eas percursos: Trail Longo de 25 km com 1000 m D+ (tempo limite de 4h00), Trail Curto de 16 km com 600 m D+ (tempo limite de 3h00) e Caminhada n\u00e3o cronometrada de 10 km com 350 m D+ (tempo limite de 3h00).<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os e fases de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">At\u00e9 3 de janeiro de 2027 (1\u00aa fase), o Trail Longo (25 km) custa 13,00\u20ac, o Trail Curto (16 km) custa 10,00\u20ac e a Caminhada (10 km) custa 8,00\u20ac. De 4 a 10 de janeiro de 2027 (2\u00aa fase), o Trail Longo passa para 15,00\u20ac, o Trail Curto para 13,00\u20ac e a Caminhada mant\u00e9m-se nos 8,00\u20ac. O evento est\u00e1 limitado a 300 vagas.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde e quando funciona o secretariado para levantamento de dorsais?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O secretariado funciona na Sede da Junta de Freguesia da Gandra (Ponte de Lima) no s\u00e1bado, 16 de janeiro de 2027, das 15:00 \u00e0s 18:00, e no domingo, dia da prova (17 de janeiro de 2027), das 08:00 \u00e0s 09:00.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Que pr\u00e9mios e escal\u00f5es est\u00e3o previstos no regulamento?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Todos os atletas que concluam a prova dentro do tempo limite recebem pr\u00e9mio Finisher. H\u00e1 trof\u00e9us para os 3 primeiros classificados da geral masculina e feminina, para os 3 primeiros de cada escal\u00e3o (Seniores 16-39 anos, M\/F40, M\/F50 e M\/F60+) no Trail Longo e Trail Curto, e trof\u00e9u para a equipa mais numerosa. A entrega de pr\u00e9mios decorre \u00e0s 12:00.<\/div><\/details><\/div><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Pir\u00e2mide Radical Trail 2027\", \"startDate\": \"2027-01-17\", \"endDate\": \"2027-01-17\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Junta de Freguesia da Gandra, Ponte de Lima\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Ponte de Lima\", \"addressRegion\": \"Viana do Castelo\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"description\": \"O Pir\u00e2mide Radical Trail 2027 realiza-se a 17 de janeiro na Gandra, Ponte de Lima. Provas de Trail 25 km (1000 m D+), 16 km (600 m D+) e Caminhada 10 km.\", \"image\": [\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/11\/cartaz-piramide-radical-trail.webp\"], \"offers\": [{\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Trail Longo 25 km\", \"price\": \"13.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/sinctime.com\/evento\/521\", \"validFrom\": \"2027-01-01\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Trail Curto 16 km\", \"price\": \"10.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/sinctime.com\/evento\/521\", \"validFrom\": \"2027-01-01\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Caminhada 10 km\", \"price\": \"8.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/sinctime.com\/evento\/521\", \"validFrom\": \"2027-01-01\"}], \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Pir\u00e2mide Radical Clube\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando e onde se realiza o Pir\u00e2mide Radical Trail 2027?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O Pir\u00e2mide Radical Trail 2027 realiza-se no domingo, 17 de Janeiro de 2027, na freguesia da Gandra, concelho de Ponte de Lima (Viana do Castelo), com secretariado e partida junto \u00e0 Sede da Junta de Freguesia da Gandra.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias, desn\u00edveis e tempos limite de cada prova?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O evento compreende tr\u00eas percursos: Trail Longo de 25 km com 1000 m D+ (tempo limite de 4h00), Trail Curto de 16 km com 600 m D+ (tempo limite de 3h00) e Caminhada n\u00e3o cronometrada de 10 km com 350 m D+ (tempo limite de 3h00).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os e fases de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"At\u00e9 3 de janeiro de 2027 (1\u00aa fase), o Trail Longo (25 km) custa 13,00\u20ac, o Trail Curto (16 km) custa 10,00\u20ac e a Caminhada (10 km) custa 8,00\u20ac. De 4 a 10 de janeiro de 2027 (2\u00aa fase), o Trail Longo passa para 15,00\u20ac, o Trail Curto para 13,00\u20ac e a Caminhada mant\u00e9m-se nos 8,00\u20ac. O evento est\u00e1 limitado a 300 vagas.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde e quando funciona o secretariado para levantamento de dorsais?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O secretariado funciona na Sede da Junta de Freguesia da Gandra (Ponte de Lima) no s\u00e1bado, 16 de janeiro de 2027, das 15:00 \u00e0s 18:00, e no domingo, dia da prova (17 de janeiro de 2027), das 08:00 \u00e0s 09:00.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Que pr\u00e9mios e escal\u00f5es est\u00e3o previstos no regulamento?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Todos os atletas que concluam a prova dentro do tempo limite recebem pr\u00e9mio Finisher. H\u00e1 trof\u00e9us para os 3 primeiros classificados da geral masculina e feminina, para os 3 primeiros de cada escal\u00e3o (Seniores 16-39 anos, M\/F40, M\/F50 e M\/F60+) no Trail Longo e Trail Curto, e trof\u00e9u para a equipa mais numerosa. A entrega de pr\u00e9mios decorre \u00e0s 12:00.\"}}]}<\/script>","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":73618,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_stat